Allow me to be the second linguist you know who thinks that Lojban is a suc=
cess as a language. Whatever its imperfections may be -- ;-) typographic an=
d otherwise -- it's got translatable (and back-translatable) literature, an=
d there is evidence of people using it to communicate over beer in a pub.=
